not receive any interest on the funds in his commodity account unless he
committed substantially more than the minimum investment required for the
partnerships. While the partnerships are credited with interest by Morgan
Stanley DW on the respective percentage of their assets deposited as margin as
described above, the form of margin posted, whether cash or interest-bearing
obligations (such as U.S. Treasury bills), does not reduce the risks inherent in
the trading of futures, forwards, and options.

